      "id": 1,
      "text": "Pelham was incorporated in 1881 and named after Confederate officer Major John Pelham, who died at the Battle of Kelly's Ford.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        4,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia",
